Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n        \n      \u003cbutton \n        class=\"\n          tw:select-none \n          tw:mx-2 \n          tw:block \n          tw:group-[.is-open]:hidden \n          tw:print:hidden!\" \n        disabled\n        aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M328 256c0 39.8-32.2 72-72 72s-72-32.2-72-72 32.2-72 72-72 72 32.2 72 72zm104-72c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72zm-352 0c-39.8 0-72 32.2-72 72s32.2 72 72 72 72-32.2 72-72-32.2-72-72-72z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw:block tw:m-0 tw:p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-17\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      tw:block! \n      tw:p-0\n      tw:m-0\n      tw:transition-[max-height] \n      tw:duration-500 \n      tw:ease-in-out \n      tw:group-[.is-closed]:max-h-0! \n      tw:group-[.is-wrap]:text-wrap\n      tw:overflow-y-hidden\n      tw:overflow-x-auto\n      tw:scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003elet\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eshow\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003efunction\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eA\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;A\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eB\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;B\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eC\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;C\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eD\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;D\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eE\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;E\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e  \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nc\"\u003eF\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;F\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"缺点\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e7%bc%ba%e7%82%b9\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e缺点\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e尽管 polymorphic variant 用起来似乎更加灵活和方便，但这是有代价的 \u003csup id=\"fnref:3\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"#fn:3\" class=\"footnote-ref\" role=\"doc-noteref\"\u003e3\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eComplexity\u003c/em\u003e：Polymorphic Variants 的 typing rule 更加复杂，特别是报错信息更不友好了\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eError-finding\u003c/em\u003e：用 Polymorphic Variants 会导致你不大容易找到 Bug\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eEfficiency\u003c/em\u003e：性能会稍微差一些\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"参考\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e5%8f%82%e8%80%83\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e参考\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"footnotes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli id=\"fn:1\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/9367181/variants-or-polymorphic-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eVariants or Polymorphic variants\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#160;\u003ca href=\"#fnref:1\" class=\"footnote-backref\" role=\"doc-backlink\"\u003e\u0026#x21a9;\u0026#xfe0e;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli id=\"fn:2\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/is-there-any-kind-of-guidline-about-when-to-use-polymorphic-variants/11006\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eIs there any kind of guideline about when to use polymorphic variants?\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#160;\u003ca href=\"#fnref:2\" class=\"footnote-backref\" role=\"doc-backlink\"\u003e\u0026#x21a9;\u0026#xfe0e;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli id=\"fn:3\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://dev.realworldocaml.org/variants.html#polymorphic-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003eReal World OCaml. When to Use Polymorphic Variants\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#160;\u003ca href=\"#fnref:3\" class=\"footnote-backref\" role=\"doc-backlink\"\u003e\u0026#x21a9;\u0026#xfe0e;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n",
        "language": "zh-cn"
    },
    {
        "title" : "为什么需要 Applicative Functor",
        "date_published" : "2024-10-20T00:14:08+08:00",
        "date_modified" : "2025-06-02T00:14:08+08:00",
        "id" : "https://martinlwx.github.io/zh-cn/why-applicative-functor/",
        "url" : "https://martinlwx.github.io/zh-cn/why-applicative-functor/",
        "summary": " Info 阅读本文之前，我假设你对 Functor 有很好的理解。可以参考之前我写的这篇介绍\n",
        "author" : {
          "name" : "MartinLwx"
        },
        "content_html" : "\u003cdiv class=\"details admonition info open\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-summary admonition-title\"\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M256 8C119.043 8 8 119.083 8 256c0 136.997 111.043 248 248 248s248-111.003 248-248C504 119.083 392.957 8 256 8zm0 110c23.196 0 42 18.804 42 42s-18.804 42-42 42-42-18.804-42-42 18.804-42 42-42zm56 254c0 6.627-5.373 12-12 12h-88c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h12v-64h-12c-6.627 0-12-5.373-12-12v-24c0-6.627 5.373-12 12-12h64c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v100h12c6.627 0 12 5.373 12 12v24z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003eInfo\u003cspan class=\"details-icon\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"details-content\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"admonition-content\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e阅读本文之前，我假设你对 Functor 有很好的理解。可以参考之前我写的\u003ca href=\"https://martinlwx.github.io/zh-cn/why-functor/\" rel=\"\"\u003e这篇介绍\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch2 id=\"为啥需要-applicative-functor\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#%e4%b8%ba%e5%95%a5%e9%9c%80%e8%a6%81-applicative-functor\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e为啥需要 Applicative Functor\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e在学习 Applicative Functor 之前，首先是一个关键的问题，为什么有了 Functor 我们还需要 Applicative Functor？\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFunctor 的 \u003ccode\u003efmap :: (a -\u0026gt; b) -\u0026gt; f a -\u0026gt; f b\u003c/code\u003e 不难理解，这里的 map 函数 \u003ccode\u003ea -\u0026gt; b\u003c/code\u003e 只有 1 个入参 \u003ccode\u003ea\u003c/code\u003e，那如果我们想要 map 包含\u003cem\u003e多个入参\u003c/em\u003e的函数呢？比如 \u003ccode\u003e(+) :: a -\u0026gt; a -\u0026gt; a\u003c/code\u003e 需要 2 个参数，那用 \u003ccode\u003efmap\u003c/code\u003e 会得到什么？看下面的代码\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw:group tw:my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw:flex \n    tw:flex-row\n    tw:flex-1 \n    tw:justify-between \n    tw:w-full tw:bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw:mx-2 \n        tw:flex\n        tw:flex-row\n        tw:flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"tw:group-[.is-open]:rotate-90 tw:transition-[transform] tw:duration-500 tw:ease-in-out tw:print:hidden! tw:w-min tw:h-min tw:my-1 tw:mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon\"\n    xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"\u003e\u003c!-- Font Awesome Free 5.15.4 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) --\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"tw:select-none tw:my-1! tw:block\"\u003ehaskell\u003c/span\u003e\n      \u003c/button\u003e\n\n   \u003cdiv class=\"tw:flex\"\u003e\n      \u003cbutton \n     